{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RYY3GLyuM01794581918.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國反映批發層面的10月生產物價指數，升幅見近四年高位。</p><p></p><p>美國勞工部公布，10月生產物價指數按年升百分之6.5，是2022年11月以來最高。按月升百分之0.3。按年和按月數據都較市場預期低0.1個百分點。</p><p></p><p>撇除食物及能源的10月核心生產物價指數，同樣按年及按月計，都較符合市場預期。數據反映美國的通脹壓力仍然存在。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:36:23.732703+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T22:22:06.425615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:29:43.056698+00:00","content_hash":"fb5ce9d1fe45f0e8f7467ee63c6f351511b4b9bc0f76988f45a47babfe77c25b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}